## 🎮 What Is GTA 6 Port Tracker?

**[GTA6Port.app](https://gta6port.app/)** is an independent GTA 6 port tracking website dedicated to following the development, rumors, and community efforts surrounding **Grand Theft Auto VI on PC**.

The website brings together official Rockstar Games announcements, GTA 6 PC port discussions, community development projects, and alleged game leaks into a continuously updated timeline.

Instead of relying on scattered social media posts, users can explore GTA 6 port developments with links to original sources and clearly identified verification statuses.

### What We Track

- **GTA 6 PC Port News** — Developments related to bringing Grand Theft Auto VI to PC.
- **GTA 6 Port Timeline** — A chronological record of important announcements, rumors, and community developments.
- **Leonida GTA 6 Port Project** — Community efforts exploring GTA 6 compatibility and porting technologies.
- **GTA 6 Leaks** — Alleged game files, screenshots, videos, and related claims.
- **Community Projects** — Public repositories, research, and technical experiments.
- **Official Rockstar Announcements** — Confirmed information about GTA VI platforms and release plans.
- **Source Verification** — Clear distinctions between confirmed information, project claims, and unverified reports.

> **Visit the live tracker: [https://gta6port.app/](https://gta6port.app/)**

