## 📅 GTA 6 Port Timeline — News, Leaks & Developments

The **GTA 6 Port Timeline** is one of the core features of GTA6Port.app.

It organizes important developments related to GTA 6 PC availability, community projects, and alleged leaks into a chronological record.

### Events Covered

- Official GTA VI announcements from Rockstar Games.
- GTA 6 PC release discussions and platform updates.
- Community attempts to investigate GTA 6 porting.
- Leonida Project announcements and repository developments.
- Alleged GTA 6 game file leaks and download claims.
- Community research into game compatibility and technical limitations.

Whenever available, timeline entries include the original source and a verification label.

### Why Verification Matters

Not every GTA 6 port claim is reliable.

Online discussions may contain misleading screenshots, fabricated download links, edited videos, or unverified technical demonstrations.

GTA6Port.app distinguishes between:

| Verification Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Official | Information published by Rockstar Games or another relevant official source |
| Verified | Information supported by independently verifiable evidence |
| Community Report | Claims or updates published by independent developers or researchers |
| Unverified | Information that lacks sufficient independent confirmation |
| Disputed | Claims contradicted by available evidence or challenged by credible sources |

